  "description": "You may have seen these kanji before—but can you actually read them?\nThis quiz game lets you enjoy learning rare and tricky Japanese kanji through fun fill-in-the-blank puzzles.\n\nFrom animals and plants to foods, place names, and everyday words, a wide variety of categories awaits.\nSome answers will come to you in a flash, while others will leave you scratching your head. The more you play, the more your vocabulary and kanji knowledge will grow.\n\nPlay solo to challenge yourself, or enjoy solving questions together with family and friends.\nTurn “I’ve seen it before” into “I can read it!” and take on a quiz experience that is both fun and rewarding.",
